# Landfill Loop: the Dumps, track 1 (SPEC 3.2). Driven clockwise on the
# map image: east along the top over the board road, down the east side
# along the open pit edge (no wall on the driver's left: leave the road and
# you drop into the landfill, SEGMENT FAULT), through the coolant spill at
# the bottom-right, west along the bottom straight over the ramp and its
# pit, over the dunes (a hill) round the west bend, east along the
# middle, and back west through the inner switchback to the line.
# Control point 0 is the start line; features on point i apply to the
# segment from point i to i+1; a segment without `open` has wreckage walls.
#
# Planned (comments only until the feature words exist):
#   crates  M2: an RMA crate row mid top straight (segment 1) and one after
#           the switchback (segment 15).
#   bay     M2: a service bay on the west side (segment 18), Zero's cold aisle.
league dumps
width 58
# x    y    half   features
 300  130   60                     # start line
 560  120   60                     # top straight (M2: crate row)
 790  150   58
 890  280   56     open:left       # the pit edge: east side, no wall on the left
 900  480   56     open:left
 850  660   56
 740  790   56     coolant         # coolant spill through the bottom-right bend
 650  900   60     ramp            # bottom straight west: the ramp over a pit
 380  900   60
 210  880   56     hill            # the dunes: a swell of the floor round the west bend
 130  760   54     hill
 220  650   54
 520  660   54
 700  610   52
 740  470   52                     # inner switchback
 640  380   52
 430  440   54     # (M2: crate row)
 300  390   54
 170  300   56                     # west side (M2: service bay)
 180  190   58
